    "retirement_reason": "Withdraw only the standalone new_owner installation of w02::a2-proposal-nbrc1132-asahi-ebios-tablets. The unchanged complete W02 proposal, original payload, raw source case, occurrence and evidence remain reconciliation evidence for the independently reviewed EBIOS tablet-family candidate a5b147248539b039caa788e4d208afdebd24c59b218082a1b5b06f266184f09a. That candidate concerns promotion of authentic data/ingredients/unmapped/EBIOS.yaml through the genuine W01 and W06 existing-owner edit origins. This retirement creates no successor source proposal, edit or preimage; it removes no case or occurrence and grants no source-route, formulation/version/lot, role, owner-application or export approval. The original W02 new_owner kind and null preimage remain historical facts. Disposition filed before this statement at https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1237#issuecomment-6720520960.",
